  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Variance and standard deviation"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The variance of X measures its spread about the mean $\\mu = E(X)$: $V(X) = E(X - \\mu)^2 = E(X^2) - [E(X)]^2$. The *standard deviation* is $\\sigma = \\sqrt{V(X)}$. Properties: $V(c) = 0$; $V(aX) = a^2V(X)$; $V(aX + b) = a^2V(X)$ (adding a constant shifts but does not spread); for independent X, Y: $V(X \\pm Y) = V(X) + V(Y)$."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "V(X) = E(X²) − [E(X)]²"
    },
    {
     "en": "V(aX + b) = a²V(X)"
    },
    {
     "en": "Independent: V(X ± Y) = V(X) + V(Y)"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Variance is the expected squared distance from the mean, E of X squared minus the square of E X. Multiplying X by a multiplies the variance by a squared; adding a constant changes nothing.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ರಸರಣ = ಸರಾಸರಿಯಿಂದ ವರ್ಗ ದೂರದ ನಿರೀಕ್ಷೆ = E(X²) − [E(X)]². X ಅನ್ನು a ಯಿಂದ ಗುಣಿಸಿದರೆ ಪ್ರಸರಣ a² ಪಟ್ಟು; ಸ್ಥಿರಾಂಕ ಕೂಡಿಸಿದರೆ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ ಇಲ್ಲ."
   },
   "formula": "V(X) = E(X^2) - [E(X)]^2",
   "reveal": true,
   "voice": [
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Variance is the expected squared distance from the mean, E of X squared minus the square of E X. Multiplying X by a multiplies the variance by a squared; adding a constant changes nothing. VX equals EX squared - [EX] squared.",
      "kn": "ಪ್ರಸರಣ equals ಸರಾಸರಿಯಿಂದ ವರ್ಗ ದೂರದ ನಿರೀಕ್ಷೆ = EX squared - [EX] squared. X ಅನ್ನು a ಯಿಂದ ಗುಣಿಸಿದರೆ ಪ್ರಸರಣ a squared ಪಟ್ಟು; ಸ್ಥಿರಾಂಕ ಕೂಡಿಸಿದರೆ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ ಇಲ್ಲ."
     }
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "VaX plus b equals a squaredVX."
     }
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "Independent: VX plus or minus Y equals VX plus VY."
     }
    }
   ]
  },
